// EN mirror of theme_style_globale_homonyme: a designated theme, and an
// ordinary global that carries the name of one of its styles. The bare name
// then denotes the ordinary global -- and nothing else. Bilingual guard
// (invariant 3): same facts as the FR fixture, written in EN canonical forms.
MyAppStyleHomonymGlobal is a Project
	PROPERTIES
		Languages = [languageEnglish]
		Theme     = ThemeStyleHomonym
	END
END
